00:25:06.750 --> 00:25:10.940
Olive is able to analyze
customer inquiries,

00:25:10.940 --> 00:25:15.770
align their intents with
actionable workflows,

00:25:15.770 --> 00:25:19.580
and then take that data, package
it up, and present it back

00:25:19.580 --> 00:25:22.940
to the consumers in
a consumable way.

00:25:22.940 --> 00:25:27.870
We have features like our store
locator and hours of operation.

00:25:27.870 --> 00:25:30.020
We also have features
to modify your lists,

00:25:30.020 --> 00:25:33.710
manage your shopping lists,
and answer any frequently asked

00:25:33.710 --> 00:25:37.120
