and then turn it into a
search just by clicking on it.

00:28:37.820 --> 00:28:41.410
You can scroll through the
results, find the one you want,

00:28:41.410 --> 00:28:43.960
quickly add it to
the cart, and then

00:28:43.960 --> 00:28:48.190
continue with the next
step, your next item,

00:28:48.190 --> 00:28:49.470
and do the same.

00:28:49.470 --> 00:28:52.360
We'll go with the
Drought Relief milk--

00:28:52.360 --> 00:28:54.147
help out the farmers--

00:28:54.147 --> 00:28:56.230
and then continue the
checkout process from there.

00:28:59.180 --> 00:29:00.290
Thanks.

00:29:00.290 --> 00:29:01.490
Switch back to the slides.

00:29:05.060 --> 00:29:08.460
And so how were we able
to accomplish this?

00:29:08.460 --> 00:29:10.190
We started with a
very simple task,

00:29:10.190 --> 00:29:16.280
to make sure that we take a real
customer impacting event, as

00:29:16.280 --> 00:29:19.280
well as a real business
impacting event,

00:29:19.280 --> 00:29:21.840
and we married them together.

00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:24.460
Our customers call
up our Customer Hub,

00:29:24.460 --> 00:29:28.280
and they want to know specific
information, information that's

00:29:28.280 --> 00:29:30.920
very readily available, but
they don't have any other way

00:29:30.920 --> 00:29:31.970
to get it.

00:29:31.970 --> 00:29:34.555
Calling up our Customer
Hub takes up time.

00:29:34.555 --> 00:29:35.930
There's a lot of
other activities

00:29:35.930 --> 00:29:38.390
that our Customer
Hub endeavors in that

00:29:38.390 --> 00:29:41.580
take up a lot more time
than they probably need to.

00:29:41.580 --> 00:29:46.190
So we utilize our voice
integrated with Dialogflow.

00:29:46.190 --> 00:29:50.270
We work with our applications
that are hosted within GKE.

00:29:50.270 --> 00:29:54.680
We then operate through Apigee
to our back end services

00:29:54.680 --> 00:29:57.470
to find the data that we need to
deliver the experience that we

00:29:57.470 --> 00:29:58.700
want.

00:29:58.700 --> 00:30:00.605
We funnel it back
into our applications

00:30:00.605 --> 00:30:04.970
in GKE, which prepares it
for delivery to the customer.

00:30:04.970 --> 00:30:09.080
Our chatbot is able to connect
to our customers via Hangouts,

00:30:09.080 --> 00:30:11.660
a chatbot virtual
assistant on our website.

00:30:11.660 --> 00:30:15.620
You can call us up on the IVR or
speak to us on the Google Home.

00:30:15.620 --> 00:30:19.790
And we utilize the
same architecture,

00:30:19.790 --> 00:30:24.530
oversimplified for this
illustration, for all of it.

00:30:24.530 --> 00:30:27.590
And that allows us
to expand even more

00:30:27.590 --> 00:30:30.260
into answering and
connecting with our customers

00:30:30.260 --> 00:30:32.090
in a digital way.

00:30:32.090 --> 00:30:35.120
We want to make sure that
it's not just our Woolworths

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:36.920
online experience
that they have access

00:30:36.920 --> 00:30:42.680
to, but also our BWS, our
Big W, Our Dan Murphy's,

00:30:42.680 --> 00:30:44.810
our money and
financial services,

00:30:44.810 --> 00:30:46.880
and we want them to be
comfortable and connect

00:30:46.880 --> 00:30:51.170
to us in any way that they would
like, over Facebook Messenger,

00:30:51.170 --> 00:30:57.188
Alexas, Homes, digital
assistants of any kind.

00:30:57.188 --> 00:30:58.980
And I think that that
brings us to the end.

00:30:58.980 --> 00:31:02.083
So we can ask any questions
if you guys have any.

00:31:02.083 --> 00:31:06.027
[APPLAUSE]

00:31:06.027 --> 00:31:07.013
Thank you.

